 <text>
  <body>
   <p><date when="1861-01-19">19</date> 
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Governor</persName> approved an account of $965.<hi rend="sup">64</hi>/<hi rend="sub">100</hi> to <orgName ref="cwgk:O00021468">S. I. M. Major &amp; Co</orgName>. for printing done by order of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00010556">Executive Department</orgName> for the year <date when="1860">1860</date>.</p>
<p>He pardoned <persName ref="cwgk:N00021446">Christian Shroeder</persName> convicted of felony by the <orgName ref="cwgk:O001000">Jefferson Circuit Court</orgName> and Sentenced to two years confinement in the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000266">Penitentiary</orgName> </p>
<p>He appointed <persName ref="cwgk:N00002295">A. S Hamlin</persName> Com<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> of Deeds for the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00018723">State of Missouri</orgName> (<placeName ref="cwgk:P00002294">S<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">t</hi></hi> Joseph</placeName>)</p>
<p>He remitted the following judgments, to wit:</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O001838">Louisville City Ct</orgName>. vs. <persName ref="cwgk:N00021448">W<hi rend="sup">m</hi> M<hi rend="sup">c</hi>Kaye</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>Concealed weapons</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>Do Do " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021449">C Townly</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>" "</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000410">Kenton Cir</orgName> " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021450">O. B. Higgins</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>Illegal voting</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>He remitted a Judgment of $50. &amp; six months imprisonment of the Kenton Circuit Court against <persName ref="cwgk:N00020559">Ferdinand Hock</persName> for Cutting in an affray.</p>
  </body>
